The MIT terms above cover the source code in this repository.

data/colin27_lh_pial.npz is not our work. It is the left pial surface of the
colin27 single-subject template anatomy, extracted from the FieldTrip toolbox
(template/anatomy/surface_pial_left.mat, commit
8e2307d7e7284c6870a5d12e244d9dc95a1faae3) and stored here as a derived NumPy
array. It is redistributed under the terms of the source toolbox, which is
released under the GNU General Public License; see https://www.fieldtriptoolbox.org.
It is a de-identified, long-published reference anatomy, not patient data.
